Verse 1:
[G]There is a Name I love to hear, I [D]love to sing its [G]worth;
[G]It sounds like music in my ears, The [Am]sweetest [G]Name [D7]on [G]earth.
[G]O how I love Jesus, [D]O how I love [G]Jesus,
[G]O [B]how I love [Em]Je[G7]sus, [Am]Because He [G]first [D7]loved [G]me.

